              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--light\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">Meet the Team</h2><div class=\"team-grid\"><div class=\"team-card reveal\"><div class=\"team-card__photo\">📸 Jason</div><div class=\"team-card__name\">Jason (yonks)</div><div class=\"team-card__role\">IT, burnout, Uber, CEPA (in training)</div><div class=\"team-card__bio\">The architect of the ownership models. Eight years of building income-producing assets, learning what works and what doesn't, so you don't have to.</div><div class=\"team-card__quote\">\"I know what it's like to have everything and hate your life anyway.\"</div></div><div class=\"team-card reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"team-card__photo\">📸 Tyler</div><div class=\"team-card__name\">Tyler (MrsYonks)</div><div class=\"team-card__role\">$3B institutional sales, FINRA arbitrator</div><div class=\"team-card__bio\">The institutional backbone. She spent decades serving the people you serve — and now she serves as an arbitrator, understanding exactly how the system works from the inside.</div><div class=\"team-card__quote\">\"I know what it's like to hit the number and still feel empty.\"</div></div></div></div></div>"
              },
